 "Cards": [
  {
   "ID": "card-legend",
   "Title": "Legend",
   "Color": "slate",
   "Legend": true,
   "Lines": [],
   "X": 40,
   "Y": 1860,
   "W": 560,
   "H": 380
  },
  {
   "ID": "card-data-plane",
   "Title": "Request path · data plane",
   "Color": "cyan",
   "Legend": false,
   "Lines": [
    "A signed-in user calls \u003capp-a\u003e, whose backend needs \u003capp-b\u003e.",
    "[1] Browser sends GET https://\u003capp-a\u003e.staging.acme.example/api/v1/…. DNS wildcard points to the edge team FIP. the edge team nginx terminates TLS.",
    "[2] the edge team forwards plain HTTP to NodePort 30080 on any worker (static Endpoints, maintained by hand).",
    "[3] eg matches the HTTPRoute by Host, checks the GitLab id-token cookie against allowedGroups, proxies /api to \u003capp-a\u003e-backend.",
    "[4] \u003capp-a\u003e-backend queries \u003capp-a\u003e-db.",
    "[5] It calls http://\u003capp-b\u003e.staging.acme.example/api from APP_B_URL. hostAliases pins that name to eg-internal: no OIDC, /api only.",
    "[6] eg-internal proxies to \u003capp-b\u003e-backend. [7] It queries \u003capp-b\u003e-db.",
    "Cilium drops everything else: frontend to backend, \u003capp-a\u003e to \u003capp-b\u003e pod to pod, \u003capp-a\u003e to \u003capp-b\u003e-db."
   ],
   "X": 630,
   "Y": 1860,
   "W": 820,
   "H": 380
  },
  {
   "ID": "card-control-plane",
   "Title": "Background · control plane",
   "Color": "violet",
   "Legend": false,
   "Lines": [
    "[A] A developer pushes. GitLab CI builds and pushes vX.Y.Z-rc.N images to the registry.",
    "[B] Image Updater polls the registry for new rc tags. [C] It commits the tag to app-configs.",
    "[D] Argo CD pulls infra + generic-app-chart + app-configs and applies each app namespace. Platform baseline values load last and win.",
    "[E] Kubelets pull the images with a read-only pull secret synced from Vault.",
    "[F] VSO authenticates with its ServiceAccount, reads kvv2 and writes plain K8s Secrets into app namespaces.",
    "[G] Dagster triggers Airbyte syncs. [H] Airbyte reads each app DB replica as bi_reader. [I] It loads bi-warehouse.",
    "Admins reach the API server and Talos API only through Boundary. No SSH, no public FIP."
   ],
   "X": 1480,
   "Y": 1860,
   "W": 900,
   "H": 380
  },
  {
   "ID": "card-gaps",
   "Title": "Gaps between docs and code",
   "Color": "orange",
   "Legend": false,
   "Lines": [
    "!!G1!! **Storage and transport.** Docs: Cinder CSI + WAL backups to Ceph S3. Code: local-path only (node-pinned), CNPG backup off. TLS ends at the edge team. the edge team to NodePort and Vault run plain HTTP.",
    "!!G2!! **Isolation.** Docs: staging and prod physically separated. Code: same subnet 10.20.0.0/24, security groups only. NodePorts 30000-32767 open to 0.0.0.0/0: any host on the subnet reaches eg without the edge team.",
    "!!G3!! **Missing services.** RabbitMQ, the observability stack and the Clock are documented, not deployed. Chart rules for RabbitMQ egress and Prometheus ingress target absent namespaces.",
    "!!G4!! **Secret scoping.** Every Vault role is bound to VSO's ServiceAccount. Per-app scoping relies on the baseline pinning vaultRole (ADR-0001), not on Vault.",
    "!!G5!! **East-west auth.** eg-internal has no SecurityPolicy: any app can call any app's /api, the callee cannot identify the caller.",
    "Sizing: docs say m1.medium workers, Terraform provisions m1.large. Leftover empty namespaces: my-app, app-templates."
   ],
   "X": 2410,
   "Y": 1860,
   "W": 950,
   "H": 380
  }
 ],
